      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">and the elder Khalaf</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">b. Yi\u1e63\u1e25aq took delivery of it. His letter will reach his excellency</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">with news of this. Your servant wanted</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">to let him know. I single out the excellency of my lord</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for the best and most abundant greetings. Greetings to the elder</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Yi\u1e63\u1e25aq al-[N]af\u016bs\u012b, [greetings] to the elder Mub\u0101rak</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">al-[M\u0101liq\u012b], and [greetings] to the elder\u00a0Ibr\u0101h\u012bm b.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Ism\u0101\u02bf\u012bl. And peace be upon my lord.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">My lord, the most illustrious [elder]: confidence in</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">your [kindness] has led me to send your excellency</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">purses of silver weighing two hundred sixty-</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">two dirhams [...], one whole robe (thawb \u1e63a\u1e25\u012b\u1e25) </li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and two split pieces (qi\u1e6d\u02bfatayn maks\u016bratayn) [...] </li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">fine (li\u1e6d\u0101f). Please be so kind as to sell this </li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and buy for your servant with the proceeds,</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
